<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">1 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wu ɛ̃kwel ola Timote</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wu ɛ̃kwel ola</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool oyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola Timote wu mbiri a Ebvɔɔn. Timote oli ndoo a Pool wu ɔ̃tio onse ɔ̃sal. Ɔ̃nkaan wu, ye wa mviaal mi éyuɔɔl Pool ola Timote ye wu éyuɔɔl ndɛ ola Tite, abeta myɛ̃ ndiri ɛ̃nkaan mi ɛ̃tal ɔ̃sal wu ambiri b'Ebvɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ke mbee a ɔ̃bio wu abebio ŋ'abɛɛn k'aswɛn ɔ̃nkaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>), onse ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1.3–3.16</ref></char>), Pool abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Ebvɔɔn. Ndɛ hɛ̃ bvool ayɛɛn me b'otal epfuũ e mbiri bwɛn a mbiri onse Ebvɔɔn. Onse ebaal ki bviaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:19">4.1–6.19</ref></char>), Pool awa Timote luo li akal ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia wu ɔ̃bvɛ. Pool asɛɛl ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ m'ãyɛɛn m'ãwɛɛl Timote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 6:20-21">6.20-21</ref></char>), bvool m'ãwa otsɛn b'ontam o ndɛ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ awa ndɛ luo li akwɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'ayiool ndɛ ngesɛ kwɛn ndɛ adzwaan y'ãtee m'ãbi-ãbi m'ãkɔɔn onse baal. Ãtee m'ãbi-ãbi omɔ̃ ãbetsɛɛn baal k'akiool ndiri bɔ akoo k'abɔɔ obvuul me nkuul ã baal bɛn anduul bɔ ɛ̃kwɔɔl. Ɔ̃sal a Timote wu ayeel baal otaa-taa b'okiool onse Yeso Mãsia. Ebvaan kwɛn Timote akiɔɔl m'otal b'emfa ki ngesɛ ki esa baal Nziã, emfa ki ngesɛ ki ekal akuul y'akiɔɔl onse Ebvɔɔn. Ndɛ hɛ̃ atal ndɔɔ ankyal, y'ɔ̃sal wu akaal b'apfiil ye wu akuu-kuu b'Ebvɔɔn. Luo li ewi Pool onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, etal hɛ̃ akiool ba lio li.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia m'ontam b'etam Nziã wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ, ye Yeso Mãsia wu oli kaã e bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola Timote, muaan a mɛ̃ wa taa-taa onse okiool. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Taal ye Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio yɛ nyiĩ, asa yɛ obvɛ bvool awa yɛ opi!<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onkyab m'atee ba mfya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Ŋ'ékeyi mɛ̃ Maseduaan, mɛ̃ étam yɛ k'akal k'Efedze, kwɛn yɛ wa baal bakyɛ ãnkunkwa wɛn abee ãtee mã mfya otee, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />bvool kwɛn yɛ liaal bɔ wɛn abee ɔ̃kwal olɔ onse ese-sam, onse ɔ̃luo wu ãnkuũ m'ankɔɔ wɛn ntɔ pyɛ. Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbebiri kɛn ɛ̃tsuun ke mboo yi akasa ɔ̃sal a Nziã wu abvuul baal me nkuul okiool. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Otsɛn be nta mɛ̃ yɛ k'asa obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn dzii li efa onse ɔ̃kwal wa tsɛtsɛ emɔɔn, kwɛn baal akal y'ãtsam mã ngesɛ, y'okiool bo ngwanyã. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Baal bakyɛ ámaasiil nkuul oyɔ, ámaatwal yi ebiri bɔ onse ãyɛɛn mɛn otsɛn pyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bɔ adzii k'akal ayiool b'ãngel, kɛn a bɔ k'akwaal otsɛn o m'eyɛɛn bɔ wɛ, onkyam o m'ebeyɛɛn bɔ y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn Ngel eli ngesɛ, okɛɛn bia-byɛ ekiaal yɔ m'emfa ki ekoo. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Bia-byɛ bvool eyɛɛ wɛn, k'áwi Ngel me ndɔɔ a baal ba dzu wɛ, áwi Ngel me ndɔɔ a baal bɛn k'abekiaal yɔ wɛ, ye bɛn k'abewa amfam bvɛɛ wɛ, ye bɛn k'abelweel Nziã wɛ, y'anga-ãbi. Áwi Ngel me ndɔɔ a b'abesiaan Nziã y'ãndɔɔ mã ngel wɛ. Áwi Ngel me ndɔɔ a b'abebam atal wuo angoo a bɔ, bvool me ndɔɔ abam a baal. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Áwi Ngel me ndɔɔ a baal b'ali y'epfuũ ki abvool ntal ye mbuul wɛn bɔ kɛn abaal bakyɛ wɛ, abɔɔl b'awal angaburu-abɔɔl, b'abesa obɔɔ̃ b'ankyal, ye baal a mfya, ye b'abelab ɛ̃kyel mi mfya, y'ãndɔɔ mbueel mɛn k'ayi nkuul mɔ̃ y'ãtee mã dzu wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Ãtee omɔ̃ ãyi nkuul mɔ̃ ye Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi lweel e Nziã. Ndɛ wu Nziã wu odzii obvɛ o bia-byɛ, áwi mɛ̃ Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyɛɛ b'obvɛ b'esi Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mɛ̃ mveel ãtuɛɛn ola Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia wu owi mɛ̃ mpɛn yi ekoo me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ mveel ndɛ ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ omwɛn kwɛn mɛ̃ mvaan ŋ'ewel ndɛ mɛ̃ onse ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Mɛ̃ wɛn tsɔɔn éli mbuul wu ákesiaan ndɛ, wu éketuaal ndɛ mpal, bvool wu éketoo ndɛ ɛ̃tswɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ osio mɛ̃ nyiĩ, ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ k'ékeyɛɛ m'ékesa mɛ̃ wɛ, bvool mɛ̃ éywɛn okiool. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />M'emfa okyɛ, Mfam a bia-byɛ osio mɛ̃ me nyiĩ a ndɛ yi enduru ɔ̃ndel, ndɛ owi mɛ̃ okiool ye dzii li eli onse Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Tal ndɔɔ yi taa-taa bvool yi ebvaan m'okiool, yɔ bu: Yeso Mãsia oyi m'ɔ̃kiri me ndɔɔ yi abvuul anga-ãbi. Mɛ̃ ndyam wu nduru ãbi onse bɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Kɛn a Nziã osio mɛ̃ nyiĩ, me ndɔɔ yɛn me nkuul a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ wu nduru ãbi, Yeso Mãsia asuo osɛ-mwiĩ o ndɛ bɛn ndel pyɛ onge eliĩ ola baal b'akieel akiool ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Yɔɔl kwɛn lweel y'omfam b'ɔ̃bu ekal bvi Ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃bu, ndɛ wɛn k'akwa wɛ, wɛn baal k'abemwɛn wɛ, bvool kɛn ndyam sii wu oli Nziã! Amɛn!<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzwaan o mvel yi ngesɛ yi okiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Muaan a mɛ̃ Timote, tal ãtee m'ewa mɛ̃ yɛ. Mɔ̃ ãyi nkuul mɔ̃ y'ãndɔɔ m'élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã tsɔɔn me ndɔɔ a yɛ. Ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ ã̀wa yɛ mpɛn m'emfa kyɛn yɛ koo k'adzwaan mvel yi ngesɛ, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />y'okiool y'ãtsam m'ɔ̃kwal mã ngesɛ. Baal bakyɛ amaabee k'ayoo ãtsam m'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ mã ngesɛ, obobɔ, bɔ bu aywɛn a okiool. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Onse baal obɔ, eli Himene y'Alekesandel. Mɛ̃ ntiɔ bɔ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Satana, kwɛn bɔ ayio k'abee Nziã obesiaan.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a baal bueel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ke nkwel ãndɔɔ mbueel, mɛ̃ ngwi luo wɛn baal asɔɔ ola Nziã, abuɛɛn, aluɔɔn bvool abveel ndɛ ãtuɛɛn, me ndɔɔ a baal bueel. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Ebvaan abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ akwɛn ye bueel b'ali y'omfam. M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ èkal y'omwiĩ bo onse opi bvool y'ɔ̃lii, onse dzuun lueel y'okuru o nzuru yueel me Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ bvool yi edzii Nziã wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Ndɛ wu odzii kwɛn baal bueel abvuul bvool ayɛɛ otaa-taa. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, ɔ̃mveel ondoo mpɛɛn-a-mpɛɛn Nziã ye baal eli kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, mbuul ondɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Ndɛ wu Yeso wu áwi elaã a ndyam onge ɔ̃bvɛn wu afuru me ndɔɔ obvuul o baal bueel. Obɔ oyɛɛn b'étsweel Mãsia me lio li éwɛɛ Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Me ndɔɔ oyɛɛn obɔ, Nziã osuul mɛ̃ ɔ̃tee bvool ntam. Ndɛ owi mɛ̃ ontam b'eyiool bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ okiool y'otaa-taa. Mɛ̃ otaa-taa eyɛɛn, mɛ̃ k'epfuru wɛ.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akaal y'abɔɔl onse Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn abɔɔl abuɛɛn ãmboo mbueel, andɛɛl mviɔɔl mi ngel ke ywel, mpuru pyɛ, obel hɛ̃ pyɛ.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Mɛ̃ nzii hɛ̃ kwɛn akaal alaal ekɔ m'emfa ki ngesɛ. Bɔ abvaan akal y'ɔ̃laal wa dzuun, wa m'emfa kyɛn k'ebiil ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal wɛ. Abee mfu yi ke bwɛn-ke-bwɛn okuru. K'ebvaan kwɛn bɔ alaal ɛ̃luu mi ɔɔl, wuo ãlie, wuo ekɔ bvi enduru ɔ̃bvɛn wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Kɛn ebvaan bɔ asuo ompal o bɔ m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ mi ngesɛ. Ndɔɔ oyɔ ebvaan m'akaal b'abeyɛɛn ndiri bɔ abesa Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Ebvaan kwɛn me lio li ayiool, akaal akal pi, ye lweel lueel. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Mɛ̃ ke ngwi ɔ̃kaal nkuul yi ayiool, wuo yi anyam bɔɔl wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ akal pi. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ási Ãdam ɛ̃kwel, Ebva ke mbee. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Wu ábvi onse pfuru hɛ̃, k'Ãdam wɛ, eli ɔ̃kaal wɛn ayepfuru ndɛ, ndɛ ofel ngel a Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ke yam, ndɛ akieel abvuul ŋ'ekieel eburu ndɛ baan, kɛn obvie ndɛ otɛɛn dzu onse okiool, onse dzii, okal mbuul wu akuru nzuru me Nziã, bvool wu asa ãndɔɔ enduul pyɛ.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ambiri b'Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Etal ndɔɔ yi ebvaan m'okiool: Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'akal mbiri a Ebvɔɔn, ndɛ ŋ'asueel ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bvɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Kɛn ebvaan kwɛn mbiri akal mbuul wu oywɛn elyal, ɔ̃lam wu ɔ̃kal kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, wɛn k'asa ãndɔɔ y'enduul wɛ, wu abetsam ngesɛ, bvool wu ebewa baal dzuun. Ebvaan ndɛ akal mbuul wu oyɛɛ k'ayɔɔ baal bvool wu okoo k'ayiool baal. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />K'ebvaan ndɛ akal ɔ̃nywã-mbal wɛ, akal mbuul a kɔɔ-kɔɔ wɛ. Ebvaan ndɛ akal y'efyɛ, akal mbuul wu odzii opi. Ndɛ k'abvaan akal ye nzal a nzi wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Ebvaan ndɛ abiri nzɔ a ndyam ngesɛ, bvool asa kwɛn baan a ndɛ akal ye lweel ye dzuun lueel. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mbuul k'ayɛɛ k'abiri nzɔ a ndyam wɛ, emfa emã kyɛn ndɛ ol'okoo k'akɛɛ baal b'Ebvɔɔn e Nziã? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />K'ebvaan ndɛ akal ɔ̃kiool wu alili wɛ. Ndɛ akal ɔ̃kiool wu alili, ondɛɛl o nzuru ol'ofoo ndɛ mviil, oŋɔ̃ ndɛ oyesiɛɛn m'obɔɔ b'etumbu kyɛn onge ki ɔ̃pfu. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Ebvaan hɛ̃ kwɛn ndɛ akal mbuul wɛn bɛn k'akiool wɛ abewa ndɛ dzuun. Obobɔ, ndɛ k'abɔɔ opfuru wɛ, bvool k'abva m'abɛɛ b'ɔ̃pfu wɛ.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ankiaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ebvaan ankiaal akal baal b'ebewa baal dzuun, akal baal bɛn k'ali ba nzɛɛn-yuaal wɛ. Bɔ k'abvaan aluul m'efua e mbal wɛ, k'abvaan hɛ̃ abɔɔ nzi me pfuru wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Ebvaan bɔ akuru nzuru m'otaa-taa b'ɔ̃yɛɛl wu áli m'edziɔɔn wu okiool y'ãtsam mã ngesɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Ebvaan kɛn akie bɔ, okɛɛn k'amwɛn bɔ y'elyal wɛ, oŋɔ̃ bɔ akoo m'osa b'ɔ̃sal a bɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, akal a bɔ abvaan akal baal b'ebewa baal dzuun. Bɔ k'abvaan akal ye kwee wɛ, k'abvaan asa ãndɔɔ y'enduul wɛ, ebvaan bɔ akal baal b'ekiool baal m'ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Ebvaan ɔ̃nkiaal akal ɔ̃lam kɛn a wu ɔ̃kal ngɔmɔ̃, bvool ayɛɛ k'abiri baan ye nzɔ a ndyam. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ankiaal b'asa ɔ̃sal a bɔ ngesɛ, abɔɔ dzuun ola baal bueel. Obobɔ, bɔ akoo k'ayɛɛn ye kaã lueel m'okiool b'obvool bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndɔɔ yi m'edziɔɔn yi nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Mɛ̃ nkel yɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu ye kaã lɛn mɛ̃ ŋ'esa eyetal yɛ alili ŋã.<verse eid="1TI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyiil m'oya, ɔ̃nkaan wu awuaal a yɛ k'ayɛɛ emfa ki ekal yɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, yi eli Ebvɔɔn e Nziã wa mwiĩ. Ndɛ wu oli kwii bvool atɛɛl otaa-taa. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ndɔɔ yi ebekiool bia-byɛ bueel ekyam pyɛ, yɔ bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ɔ̃yɛɛl a Nziã wa m'edziɔɔn wu otal okuru o bia-byɛ nzuru me ndɛ oli wu ɔ̃nɛn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Mãsia áyi m'emfa ki ombuul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal osuo ndiri ndɛ oli dzu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">ãnzwel ãmwɛn ndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">atee me nkuũ a ndɛ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">baal bibi akiool ndɛ m'ɔ̃kiri wueel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">andɛɛl ndɛ oyɛn ywel onse lweel.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Pool owi Timote luo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Ke yam, Ɔ̃fel ayɛɛn kal-a-kal ndiri: M'ãlio mã ntɔ baal bakyɛ akieel ayiri okiool me ndɔɔ yi akuru ãnzuru m'ɛ̃fel mi edzeel baal bvool m'ãtee m'ã̀fa ol'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Bɔ akieel awa ãnzuru me baal a mfya bvool ba nzɛɛn-yuaal apfuru bɔ. Baal a pfuru obɔ, bɛn ãtsam ã bɔ ãm'ãbii onge m'ãdzio me bvieel li mbaa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Baal obɔ akieel aluo baal k'abaal, k'adza eluɔ bvikyɛ bvɛn Nziã ási bvɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn akiool b'ayɛɛ otaa-taa, adza bvɛ m'otuɛɛn o ndɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bvieel bvi ési Nziã eli ngesɛ, bvool ki abee pyɛ. Kɛn a yi enduru okuun yi adza bvɛ onse obveel o Nziã ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Ke yam, Endɔɔ e Nziã y'ãbuɛɛn ãsuul bvɛ ngesɛ ke mviil ã Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ŋɛn yɛ tee akiool ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, yɛ àkal ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia wa ngesɛ, yɛ asuo kwɛn aliil yɛ m'ãyɛɛn m'okiool y'ãtee mã taa-taa m'eluɛɛn yɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Bee ese-sam bvi ngwel-a-ngwel bvool bvɛn k'edzuu nkuul mɔ̃ y'okiool wɛ. Sa mpɛn k'akuru nzuru me Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ɛ̃taan ɛ̃ nzuru ɛ̃li ngesɛ, kɛn a ke m'ãndɔɔ bibi wɛ. Ki ngesɛ m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, okuru o nzuru me Nziã, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ owa elaã li elieel Nziã ndiri ndɛ awa meba, ye li elieel ndɛ ndiri ndɛ akieel awa. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi taa-taa, yi ebvaan m'okiool me baal bueel. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Ngwanyã, okɛɛn bia-byɛ ebedzwaan bvool ebebam nzuru m'ɔ̃sal, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ ebeta kaã me Nziã wa mwiĩ wu oli Ɔ̃mvuul a baal bueel, bvel-bvel b'akiool ndɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ mɛn ebvaan yɛ atam baal osa bvool yɛ ayiool bɔ mɔ̃. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ abee yɛ opfiɔɔl me ndɔɔ yi eli yɛ nsam. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ kal mbuul wɛn akiool anɔɔn kuul e ndɛ, m'ayɛɛn, m'epfuũ, me dzii, m'okiool y'okal tsɛ-tsɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ye k'eya mɛ̃, wa ɔ̃kwal k'atsiɔ m'ákel ke nkwel a baal bueel, k'atee bvool k'ayiool baal mɔ̃. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Bee kab li Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal li eli onse yɛ odzɛɛn. Kab olɔ li éyɔɔ yɛ ŋ'éyɛɛn aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bvool ŋ'éndɔɔl akuul b'Ebvɔɔn yɛ mviɔɔl. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Wa ɔ̃kwal onse ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel bvool wa nzuru a yɛ yam yueel m'ɔ̃sal ondɛ. M'emfa okyɛ baal bueel amwɛn k'eyi yɛ nkwel. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Kyab nzuru bvool kal y'onkyab onse ãtee ã yɛ. Kal y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ m'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ asa obobɔ, yɛ abvuul nzuru a yam ye b'ayoo yɛ.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ m'asa m'obiri b'Ebvɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Bee ye mbuul wu amaayal mpɛn-mpɛn oyɛɛn. Kɛn a yɛ awa ndɛ luo onge bɛn ndɛ oli tal a yɛ. Wa ãnsam luo onge baan-ngoo a yɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Akaal b'amaayal, wa bɔ luo onge bɛn bɔ ali angoo a yɛ, b'ali ãnsam m'akaal, wal bɔ onge ankyel a yɛ, onse otsɛ-tsɛ bueel.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Kal ye bvɛɛ li akaal b'apfiil, bɛn taa-taa ali bam sii. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Kɛn okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil oli ye baan wuo atiɔɔl, ebvaan kwɛn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel bɔ asuo onziã o bɔ onse owuaal b'ewuaal a bɔ yam e bɔ. Bɔ abveel aburu a bɔ obvɛ b'ési bɔ bɔ. Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi edzii Nziã. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil wu oli y'osii, wɛn wu awuaal a ndɛ pyɛ, alɔ okiool o ndɛ me Nziã. Ndɛ abuɛɛn Nziã tsia mwiĩ kwɛn ndɛ awuaal a ndɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Kɛn ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil wu akal onse efua, ŋ'amaakwa, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ oli mwiĩ. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'etam yɛ bɔ osa, kwɛn bɔ akal baal b'aywɛn elyal. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ŋɛn mbuul k'asiɔɔl eburu ndɛ wɛ, bvel-bvel baal ba yam e ndyam, ndɛ ŋ'ayiri okiool o ndɛ, bvool oli ɔ̃bi onduru wɛn k'akiool Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />M'oswɛn o yɛ nkuũ mbuul onge ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil onse ɔ̃luo wu akaal b'apfiil, obvie ndɛ mvel enduru otsiaal ekal ãku-ãsɛɛn (60). Ndɔɔ yinkyɛ yɛn obvie ábaal ndɛ kɛn a m'ɔ̃lam ngɔmɔ̃, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />bvool ebvaan ndɛ akal wɛn baal ayɛɛ ndɛ m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ mi ngesɛ: Okɛɛn ndɛ ákuul baan a ndɛ ngesɛ, ákeyɔɔ baal ngesɛ, ákesuɔɔl ntaã e ba ngel, ákewuaal b'ali onse fool, bvool ákesa ɛ̃sal mi ɛ̃bvɛ-ɛ̃bvɛ mi emfa bwɛn emfa.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Me b'otal apfiil b'ãnsam, bee bɔ onse ɔ̃luo wu apfiil olɔ, ke ngwel wɛ, ŋɛn bɔ aluul m'efua ki abaal bvool, bɔ atiɔ Mãsia eboo. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ abɔɔ etsob me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ k'asi ndɔɔ yi elab bɔ ɔ̃kyel ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ke nkwel a Mãsia wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Ndɔɔ yikyɛ yɛn, onge bɛn bɔ ayii ki asa pyɛ, bɔ akal y'epfuũ bvi adzuu me nzɔ bwɛn a nzɔ. Ndɔɔ yi enduru mbi yɛn, bɔ akal ye ndiaal, baal bɛn k'akwɛ ndɔɔ wɛ bvool b'abeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ mɛn k'ãtal bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn apfiil b'ãnsam akaal abaal bvool, kwɛn bɔ aburu baan, abiri ãnzɔ ã bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ k'awa ataal a bia-byɛ mpwe yam yi akwee bia-byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, apfiil ke kwɛ amaasiil nkuul yi dzu m'oluɛɛn o Satana. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Kɛn okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃kiool oli y'apfiil onse yam e ndɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ atal ãndɔɔ ã bɔ, abee pfuũ e bɔ owa m'Ebvɔɔn. M'emfa okyɛ, Ebvɔɔn etal ãndɔɔ m'apfiil b'aywɛn a b'awuaal a bɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Aku-kuul b'abiri Ebvɔɔn ngesɛ, bvel-bvel b'ali ye pfuũ li abetee bvool abeyiool, ebvaan bɔ abɔɔ lweel nsa yuaal. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ayɛɛn ndiri: «Oyɛɛ k'ekuru ɔ̃nywã a ngwɛmbɛ ŋ'enyii ndɛ nsia e bele wɛ.» Ndɛ bvool olieel ndiri: «Ɔ̃sal obvaan abɔɔ furu e ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Det 25.4</ref> ; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10.10</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Ŋɛn mbuul oyefɛn ɔ̃kuul Ebvɔɔn ola yɛ, oyɛɛ ke kiool ndɛ wɛ. Yɛ m'okiool, obvie ekal y'amwɛn wuo ayoo buaal wuo atyel. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Baal b'asa ãbi, wa bɔ mbyel ke nkwel a baal bueel, kwɛn bakyɛ hɛ̃ akal ye buɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ke nkwel a Nziã, ke nkwel a Yeso Mãsia, ke nkwel ãnzwel m'ásueel, mɛ̃ ngwi yɛ pfuũ li anɔɔn k'asa ãndɔɔ me ntam mɛ̃ yɛ osa. Bee ãsu ã baal osuaal, bee hɛ̃ y'ɔ̃bɛɛ okal. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Bee nkaã osa yi andɔɔl mbuul mviɔɔl. Bee hɛ̃ onse ãbi ã mbuul osam, kwɛɛ nzuru a yɛ yam tsɛtsɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Abee kɛn ãdza obenywã, anywã hɛ̃ embal-mbal e bvine me ndɔɔ a mwiĩ wu abesa yɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn yɛ abeluu bibi.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ãbi ã baal bakyɛ ãbemɔɔn bam ye k'atsiil ãndɔɔ ã bɔ. Kɛn a mã bakyɛ, abeyɛɛ mɔ̃ kɛn ãmbee. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Eli emfa kiki hɛ̃ m'ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ: Myɛ̃ ɛ̃bemɔɔn kal-a-kal tswa-a-tswa ola baal bakyɛ, kɛn ke mboo yɛn myɛ̃ k'ɛ̃mɔɔn tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃ wɛ, myɛ̃ k'ɛ̃koo k'ɛ̃kal m'edziɔɔn ɔ̃bu wɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Akiool bueel b'ali onse onkyal, ebvaan bɔ awa amfam a bɔ bvɛɛ lam, kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ abee Nziã wuo ãtee ã bia-byɛ osiaan. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn b'ali y'amfam b'akiool, bɔ abee bɔ mviɔɔl olɔ, ɔ̃tswɛ-pa wu eli bɔ andoo a bɔ ba dzii. Ke yam, ebvaan bɔ asal me ndɔɔ akiool obɔ bam ngesɛ, ke ngwel wɛ amfam b'atwal bvel li ɔ̃sal a bɔ obɔ ali andoo a bɔ ba dzii. Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'etee yɛ bvool atam baal mɔ̃ osa.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãtee mɛn k'ãdzuu nkuul mɔ̃ y'okiool wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ŋɛn mbuul otee ãtee ãkyam, bvool k'akuru nzuru m'ãyɛɛn mã dzu mã Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ, y'ãtee m'ãdzuu nkuul mɔ̃ y'okiool o bia-byɛ wɛ, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />ŋɛn mbuul ondɛ oli y'ondɛɛl o nzuru, ndɛ ki ayɛɛ pyɛ. Ndɛ oli y'oluu b'ɛ̃tsuun ye bo nzal a obel me ndɔɔ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ. Oyɔ mboo yi ebepal nsɔɔ, y'obel, y'ɛ̃tswɛ, y'ɛ̃dzoo mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Y'ɛ̃tsuun myɛn k'ɛ̃fa wɛ mi baal bɛn ãyal ãmaayi nkel, b'aywɛn a otaa-taa. Bɔ abewal okiool me Nziã onge nkuul yi abɔɔ opfel. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ke yam, okiool me Nziã oli opfel b'onɛn, kɛn ebvaan mbuul akal y'esɛ m'eluɔ ki eli a ndɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ k'eli ye ki éyi a bia-byɛ m'ɔ̃kiri wɛ, emfa kiki hɛ̃ bia-byɛ kieel k'embal m'ɔ̃kiri y'eluɔ wɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn okɛɛn bia-byɛ ebɔɔ bvi-odza y'ekɔ, bia-byɛ ekal y'esɛ me bvɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Kɛn a b'adzii bam k'akal y'opfel abva m'ɔ̃mbio, me bɛɛ, bvool onse efua bvɛn otsɛn pyɛ bvool bvi ebi-ebi, bvi ebiri baal k'epfu y'odziɔɔn. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, nzal a nzi, mboo yi ebeya ãpal mbueel. Baal bibi b'alɔ ɔ̃kwal bam onse obɔɔ o yɔ adziɔɔn lala y'okiool, bvool awi ãnzuru ã bam fool li bibi.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luo li ewi Pool Timote onge ɔ̃sal a Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Me b'otal yɛ, yɛ wu ɔ̃sal a Nziã, bal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. Bii k'akal dzu, kuru nzuru me Nziã. Kal y'okiool, ye dzii, y'osɛ-mwiĩ y'efyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Dzwaan mvel yi ngesɛ yi okiool. Bvuru elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã áti yɛ mbel k'ayɛɛ lɔ, bvool lɛn me ndɔɔ alɔ, yɛ átsweel otsweel bo ngesɛ ke nkwel a amwɛn bibi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ke nkwel a Nziã, wu awa eluɔ bvieel omwiĩ, bvool ke nkwel a Yeso Mãsia wu átsweel otsweel bo ngesɛ ke nkwel a Ponse Pilate, mɛ̃ ntam yɛ k'asa bubu: <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Kwɛɛ ndɔɔ yi atam yɛ osa ekal mbiin pyɛ, elyal pyɛ, tiil tsoo li èya Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Oya obɔ okieel okal me lio li éwɛɛ Nziã. Ndɛ wu Nziã oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ wu oli y'Omfam, oli wu awa esɛ, ndɛ oli Ɔ̃kwɛn a akwɛn bueel, oli hɛ̃ Mfam a amfam bueel. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Ndɛ oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn k'akwa wɛ. Ndɛ abekal ke mwiĩ wɛn mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ k'akoo m'osyal ke ndɛ wɛ. Mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn amwɛn ndɛ wu Nziã wɛ, k'akoo m'omwɛn ndɛ hɛ̃ wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn nkuũ a ndɛ ekal ye bvɛɛ ye waan ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Amɛn!<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luo me ndɔɔ apfel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Yiool apfel b'onse ɔ̃kiri wu wɛn abee y'ondɛɛl o nzuru okal, bvool abee kaã ota m'opfel bɛn k'oyiil wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ ata kaã me Nziã wu abewa bia-byɛ bvieel ngamfɛn, kwɛn bia-byɛ eyoo esɛ me bvɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Yiool bɔ k'asa obvɛ, akal apfel mi ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ, akal ye kab, akal y'esɛ ki akab baal eluɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />M'emfa okyɛ, me ndɔɔ ãtsoo m'ã̀ya, bɔ àbvool opfel b'obvɛ-obvɛ bvool bɛn k'otsiɔ̃ wɛ me ndɔɔ a bam, m'obɔɔ b'elaã li lɔ-a-lɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãluo mã ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ee Timote, kwɛɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ ãndɔɔ m'áwi yɛ. Bee ãyɛɛn mã ngwel-a-ngwel bvool m'ãkam y'okiool. Bee hɛ̃ ɛ̃dzoo mi ãndɔɔ m'abeyɛɛn m'odzɛɛn ndiri eli oyɛɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Baal bakyɛ abetsam ndiri bɔ ali y'oyɛɛ obɔ. M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ ayɛn lala y'okiool. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio byɛ nyiĩ!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>